<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Netcom On-Line raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Netcom On-Line raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Netcom On-Line Communications Inc to buy from hold, citing the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- said believes there is little downside in Netcom's stock price at current levels.</p>
<p>-- said believes current share price is below breakup value and the possibility of a merger or acquisition has increased.</p>
<p>-- said believes management is moving the company in the right direction.</p>
<p>-- Netcom gained 1-7/16 to 9-7/8.</p>
</text>
